    ["<Yellow>Shepherd Souls</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period of time, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows them to consume it, causing different effects based on the soul's type: \nConsume a Beyonder's soul: Deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to it and gain one skill of the corresponding Sequence by imprisoning its soul. Using this skill releases the soul: \n    Warrior Sequence: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n    Bard Sequence: <Yellow>Solar Oath</>; \n    Apprentice Sequence: <Yellow>Nebula Aria</>; \n    Spectator Sequence: <Yellow>Psychological Suggestion</>; \n    Seer Sequence: <Yellow>Realm of Mysteries</>; \n    Mystery Pryer Sequence: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \nWhen Creeping Hunger increases its danger level, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nConsume a monster's soul: Instantly shatter the soul, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to the target and <Yellow>5</> surrounding monsters, and apply <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect to the target for <Yellow>5</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Until the imprisoned soul is released, you cannot strip a soul from its owner again. You can imprison up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls simultaneously."] = "<Yellow>Shepherd Souls</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period of time, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows them to consume it, causing different effects based on the soul's type: \nConsume a Потусторонний's soul: Deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to it and gain one skill of the corresponding Последовательность by imprisoning its soul. Using this skill releases the soul: \n    Warrior Последовательность: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n    Bard Последовательность: <Yellow>Solar Oath</>; \n    Apprentice Последовательность: <Yellow>Nebula Aria</>; \n    Зритель Последовательность: <Yellow>Psychological Suggestion</>; \n    Провидец Последовательность: <Yellow>Realm of Mysteries</>; \n    Подглядывающий за Тайнами Последовательность: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \nWhen Creeping Hunger increases its danger level, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nConsume a monster's soul: Instantly shatter the soul, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to the target and <Yellow>5</> surrounding monsters, and apply <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect to the target for <Yellow>5</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Until the imprisoned soul is released, you cannot strip a soul from its owner again. You can imprison up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls simultaneously.",
