    ["Team up with your Covenant partner to complete various daily activities to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase your Covenant Level.\nThere are multiple Covenant Levels; reach the specified level to claim level rewards.\nBeyonders can earn a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner and a maximum of 2000 per week. Teaming up with your Covenant partner to participate in designated activities will also grant additional Companion Emblems.\nEntering the Utopia Theater with your Covenant partner in duo mode allows you to reach the dungeon's target rating and earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems.\nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require reaching the specified Covenant Level).\nBeyonders can click to change the display stand, enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Covenant partner, change their character's pose (cannot edit the other person's), change the duo homepage display stand, and place ornaments.\nBeyonders can apply for a solo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Beyonder who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution.\nBeyonders can also team up to apply for a duo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution."] = "Team up with your Covenant partner to complete various daily activities to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. Covenant Points can be used to automatically increase your Covenant Level.\nThere are multiple Covenant Levels; reach the specified level to claim level rewards.\nПотустороннийs can earn a maximum of 600 Covenant Points per day with a single Covenant partner and a maximum of 2000 per week. Teaming up with your Covenant partner to participate in designated activities will also grant additional Companion Emblems.\nEntering the Utopia Theater with your Covenant partner in duo mode allows you to reach the dungeon's target rating and earn more Covenant Points and Companion Emblems.\nCompanion Emblems can be used to purchase items in the Companion Shop (Covenant-related rewards require reaching the specified Covenant Level).\nПотустороннийs can click to change the display stand, enter the homepage editing function for the corresponding Covenant partner, change their character's pose (cannot edit the other person's), change the duo homepage display stand, and place ornaments.\nПотустороннийs can apply for a solo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, you can officially pay the bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, the Потусторонний who initiated the application can cancel the dissolution.\nПотустороннийs can also team up to apply for a duo dissolution of the Covenant at Mrs. Sammer's. After applying, a 24-hour cooling-off period will begin. Once the cooling-off period ends, both parties can officially pay a small amount of bound soli at Mrs. Sammer's to dissolve the Covenant. During the cooling-off period, both parties can cancel the dissolution.",
